      <ul>
        <li>You visit the same country on an irregular schedule and want data that doesn't expire while you wait</li>
        <li>You'd rather pay with crypto or keep a running account balance than check out separately every trip</li>
        <li>You want to buy ahead and schedule the plan to start on a specific future date</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="decision-card decision-card--alt">
      <h3>Consider alternatives</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>You want a code-based discount you can actually stack today: see <a href="/airhub/">Airhub</a> or <a href="/redteago/">RedteaGO</a> for cheap per-GB pricing with a working code</li>
        <li>You want a plan built around never expiring by default rather than paying extra for that tier: see <a href="/nomad/">Nomad</a>, whose Global-EX bundles are built for exactly that</li>
      </ul>
